        <a href="https://github.com/statsmodels/statsmodels/issues/10274">statsmodels issue #10274</a>
        — original report, reproducer, numerical diagnosis, and completed disposition
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://github.com/statsmodels/statsmodels/pull/10276">statsmodels pull request #10276</a>
        — repair, regression tests, review, and merge record
      </li>
